Package: chartkickR
Title: Create Interactive Chartkick.js Charts in R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(
        given = "Bilikisu",
        family = "Olatunji",
        email = "bilqiiswunmi@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-9144-6423")
