Description: Provides an R interface to the Chartkick.js JavaScript charting 
    library using the htmlwidgets framework. The package allows users to create 
    interactive line, bar, column, area, pie, donut, scatter, bubble, geo, and 
    timeline charts from R data frames with minimal code.
